<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Oct 19--AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Oct 19--AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---10/19/96  10/12/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		    17.1	28,179    24,063    27,484</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   4.4	 9,683     9,279     9,867</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  19.6	 2,434     2,035     2,067</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	  -2.1	20,068    20,497    20,290</p>
